# Transitions
@scenario tutorial_lesson_05
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg room]
[char ginger global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show ginger guide shy]
ginger: Keep your eyes on the wall. I'll fade the lights and bring the scene back.
[if !tutorial_still]
[transition fade 380]
[endif]
[stage dusk]
ginger: Change the fade duration and replay the transition.
> Review question -> check
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label check
ginger: Which value changes how long the fade lasts?
> The duration in milliseconds. -> correct
> The number of dialogue lines. -> retry
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label retry
[show ginger guide confused]
ginger: Timing belongs to the transition, so the script can keep its pacing. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show ginger guide normal]
ginger: Timing belongs to the transition, so the script can keep its pacing.
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Replay example -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_05]
[flag tutorial_done_05]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_2]
